# /review

When the user runs `/review`, follow these steps:

1. Read `proposals.md` from the project root.
2. Parse every `## ` heading as a proposal title. Collect the body text below each heading as the proposal body (everything up to the next `## ` or end of file).
3. Follow the instructions in `.cursor/prompts/review.md` exactly.
4. Write the resulting `session.json` to the project root.
5. Confirm to the user: how many proposals were loaded, and what `session.json` now contains.

Only trigger this rule when the user message starts with `/review` or explicitly asks to load proposals into the app.
